Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:41:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] nir: Fix incorrect is_ssa replacement

opt_copy_prop_vars has its own is_ssa bool that should not have been
modified when dropping is_ssa from core nir.

Generated with
git show 579bc1e72e9e8676d5432d705875cc70d392d3df -- src/compiler/nir/nir_opt_copy_prop_vars.c | git apply -3 -R
git show 95e3df39c0b -- src/compiler/nir/nir_opt_copy_prop_vars.c | git apply -3 -R

Fixes: 579bc1e72e9 ("treewide: Drop some is_ssa if's")
Fixes: 95e3df39c0b ("treewide: sed out more is_ssa")
Reviewed-by: Faith Ekstrand <faith.ekstrand@collabora.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/46029>
(cherry picked from commit 17e0d46bce11a7f5a547ff257014e1ee9368295e)
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/8d5b945c98b9193a4a3b340b8d33080b111281f6
